# Confirm DODGE as every team's default, as built and with our own fire weighed as PATH weighs it
# (TMODE-27, TMODE-29, BENCH-140; docs/plan-team-top5.md section 15). Team thread: team-only, duel and
# melee fixtures bit for bit. pc-team-dodge (PR #437), on top of PATH: DODGE for every team +0.55 ± 0.50
# APS (gate PASS, low end +0.05), the per-team table +0.24 ± 0.17 (FAIL), and our bullets on our own
# members up 13% (80.5 vs 71.2 a battle): DODGE drops MATEFIRE's teammate-bullet risk from its base
# ranking and folds the teammates' bullets into the median-scaled wave damage. df keeps both as PATH has them.
#   d2prep  build aa, bb, dg (DODGE forced on) and dgdf (DODGE with OWN_FIRE)
#   d2bb    bb vs aa, 46 teams x 16 fresh seeds (base 5600), 12 rounds as pc-team-dodge; d2dg and d2df the same for each arm
#   d2sdg, d2sdf  projected team APS change for each arm = sum of its per-team gain less half of bb's / 46
#           (gate: +0.30 with the 95% low end above zero). The card changes nothing: on a PASS the
#           better passing arm ships as FORCE_DODGE (with OWN_FIRE if df) in a PR.
# Each seed is a pair (the arm and aa): 3 x 46 x 16 x 2 = 4,416 battles, about 5 h at 12 workers
# (sizes itself to the host). Every step resumes where it stopped.
# Stop rules on every battle step (halt; every battle fought is kept and a rerun resumes): 20 failed
# battles (a broken jar), no battle in 30 minutes (a hung step), or 40+ skipped turns a battle over the
# last 100 (the PR #331 build-up). A halt at the very start leaves the whole card unrun (4,416 battles,
# about 5 h); a halt in d2bb leaves the rest of d2bb plus all 2,944 of d2dg and d2df; in d2dg, the
# rest of d2dg plus all 1,472 of d2df; in d2df, the rest of d2df. No early finish on score: each gate
# is pooled over all 46 teams.
# The team thread reads claude/pc-team-dodge2-results.
#   ./queue.sh run pc-team-dodge2        (or  .\queue.ps1 run pc-team-dodge2)
# Run it from master (one bench queue at a time):
#   git checkout master && git pull

set OUT = ../docs/bench/local
set T = python3 tools/team_modes.py

d2prep | git checkout -q master && V=$(sed -n 's:.*<robot.release>\(.*\)</robot.release>.*:\1:p' ../hadur-robot/pom.xml) && test -n "$V" && rm -f bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_"$V"aa.jar bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_"$V"bb.jar bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_"$V"dg.jar bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_"$V"dgdf.jar && rm -f ${OUT}/team-dodge2-*.md && ./fetch-opponents.sh --set team-census46.txt && bash ./build-ablation.sh aa && bash ./build-ablation.sh bb && bash ./build-ablation.sh tmdodge && bash ./build-ablation.sh tmdodge,tmdodgef && mkdir -p work && rm -rf work/team-dodge2-"$V"-bb work/team-dodge2-"$V"-dg work/team-dodge2-"$V"-df && for a in bb dg df; do sed "s/@V@/$V/g" plans/team-dodge2-$a.args > work/team-dodge2-$a.args || exit 1; done && for j in aa bb dg dgdf; do test -f bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_"$V"$j.jar || exit 1; done && mvn -q compile
d2bb   | mvn -q exec:java "-Dexec.args=@work/team-dodge2-bb.args"
  after: d2prep
  watch: battles=1472
  stop: fails 20
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100
d2dg   | mvn -q exec:java "-Dexec.args=@work/team-dodge2-dg.args"
  after: d2bb
  watch: battles=1472
  stop: fails 20
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100
d2df   | mvn -q exec:java "-Dexec.args=@work/team-dodge2-df.args"
  after: d2dg
  watch: battles=1472
  stop: fails 20
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100
d2sdg  | ${T} gate --report ${OUT}/team-dodge2-dg.md --control ${OUT}/team-dodge2-bb.md --set team-census46.txt --seeds 16 --teams 46 --min-aps 0.3 --out-md ${OUT}/team-dodge2-verdict-dg.md
  after: d2df
d2sdf  | ${T} gate --report ${OUT}/team-dodge2-df.md --control ${OUT}/team-dodge2-bb.md --set team-census46.txt --seeds 16 --teams 46 --min-aps 0.3 --out-md ${OUT}/team-dodge2-verdict-df.md
  after: d2sdg
d2pr   | bash tools/open_results_pr.sh claude/pc-team-dodge2-results "Ogi's dodge on every team: fresh-seed confirm, with and without own fire" $(ls ${OUT}/team-dodge2-*.md 2>/dev/null)
  after: d2sdf
